<metadata><name>Day 61 (stop 2 of 2) - The Gap, Lindenwood Pond</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.667404" lon="-80.989893"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking at the end of Concession 14. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.670281" lon="-80.986312"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Lindenwood Pond Side Trail, heading north-west. (the blue-blazed The Gap Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.675062" lon="-80.985112"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
